Scientific provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This workflow is an implementation of the pipeline described in:

  Iqrah, J. M., Koo, Y., Wang, W., Xie, H. & Prasad, S. K. (2025).
  "Scalable Higher Resolution Polar Sea Ice Classification and Freeboard
  Calculation from ICESat-2 ATL03 Data."
  IEEE International Parallel and Distributed Processing Symposium Workshops.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.02700

The processing steps in bin/ are derived from the authors' Jupyter notebooks at
https://github.com/jmiqra/Sentinel-2_Sea-Ice_Classification. The scientific
method is theirs; this repository restructures it as a reproducible Pegasus
workflow. Differences from the published method are documented in
GAP_ANALYSIS.md.

